  "translation": "Na David i sanapim olgeta ⟨את⟩ ol bikman bilong Yisrael — ol bikman bilong ol septa, na ol bikman bilong ol grup i save wokim wok ⟨את⟩ king, na ol bikman bilong ol tausen, na ol bikman bilong ol handet, na ol bikman bilong olgeta ol samting bilong king na bilong ol pikinini man bilong en, wantaim ol man i lukautim haus bilong ol meri, na ol man strong long pait, na olgeta man strong long pait — i kam long Yerusalayim.",
